          "host": [
            "localhost"
          ],
          "port": "8083",
          "path": [
            "api",
            "uav",
            "42",
            "start"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Streams the uploaded file. startAt (optional, default now) must be now or up to 7 days ahead: it is registered with Wowza as the stream's clock origin, then streaming starts at that time. Give the telemetry simulator the same startAt. 202 scheduled, 404 nothing uploaded, 409 already scheduled/streaming, 502 Wowza didn't accept the clock. Stream loops indefinitely once started -- always follow up with Stop UAV Stream."
      },
